# Explicit binary marking, so line-ending conversion never touches these —
# relying on Git's NUL-byte heuristic alone is fine in practice but noisy
# (it still prints a CRLF warning before deciding) and one edge case away
# from actually corrupting a binary file on a Windows checkout.
*.pdf   -text binary
*.png   -text binary
*.jpg   -text binary
*.jpeg  -text binary
*.ico   -text binary
*.woff  -text binary
*.woff2 -text binary
